   "versionNonce": 544162960,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "text": "* v2.1, off until approved: after both approvals the agent itself creates the user, group and\n  membership, mails the one-time TAP, and assigns allow-listed roles - never admin roles.\n  Whatever it cannot do goes to the team, and the agent checks the team's report.\n- Mapping sheet changed: the review runs again; a changed group or role needs both approvals again.\n- Review failed 3 times: Failed, needs developer; an Operator resumes it after the fix.\n- Each step has an SLA: a reminder at the SLA, escalation to the manager at twice the SLA.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "* v2.1, off until approved: after both approvals the agent itself creates the user, group and\n  membership, mails the one-time TAP, and assigns allow-listed roles - never admin roles.\n  Whatever it cannot do goes to the team, and the agent checks the team's report.\n- Mapping sheet changed: the review runs again; a changed group or role needs both approvals again.\n- Review failed 3 times: Failed, needs developer; an Operator resumes it after the fix.\n- Each step has an SLA: a reminder at the SLA, escalation to the manager at twice the SLA.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": false
  }
